ations for nine months ended 31.12.2020 is Rs. 70.03 instead of Rs. 69.96 calculated as per table.   n  n7. EPS for the quarter and nine months ended 31.12.2020 from Continuing operations, Discontinued operations and Continuing and Discontinued operations is not annualised.   n  nOCI Segment:   n8. Income tax relating items that will not be classified to Profit or loss includes income tax relating to items that will not be reclassified to Profit or loss from Continuing operations and Discontinued operations.</in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock>
